// Blink -- the smallest program that shows a board is alive.
//
// D13 is the LED soldered to an Uno, so this needs no wiring. The timer is
// what makes it a CandySpeak program rather than a delay loop: T restarts
// itself on its own timeout, and the LED follows from the same edge.
#digital Led out 13
#timer   T 500 = 1        // = 1 starts it at boot

Led = !Led ? timeout(T)
T   = 1    ? timeout(T)   // rearm, so the timeout repeats
